WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.182 --> 00:00:02.216
not only using missiles to send

00:00:02.383 --> 00:00:03.551
a message to the world.

00:00:03.685 --> 00:00:07.589
Will Ripley is "Outfront."

00:00:07.722 --> 00:00:08.656
&gt;&gt; Reporter: The massive missile

00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:11.359
is a menacing sight moving into

00:00:11.492 --> 00:00:14.295
place at Pyongyang's airport.

00:00:14.429 --> 00:00:15.263
North Korean leader Kim Jong Un

00:00:15.396 --> 00:00:17.298
gave the order just hours ahead

00:00:17.432 --> 00:00:19.200
of Saturday's surprise launch,

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.669
state media says.

00:00:21.803 --> 00:00:22.403
This intercontinental ballistic

00:00:22.537 --> 00:00:25.907
missile a huasong-15, hitting

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:27.375
hypersonic speeds hurdling high

00:00:27.508 --> 00:00:30.211
above the Earth, barrelling back

00:00:30.345 --> 00:00:32.814
down to Japan's territorial

00:00:33.214 --> 00:00:34.282
waters about 67 minutes later.

00:00:34.415 --> 00:00:35.683
Saturday's missile one of many

00:00:35.817 --> 00:00:37.785
on display just last week, a

00:00:37.919 --> 00:00:40.188
record number of icbms, more

00:00:40.321 --> 00:00:43.358
than any military parade in

00:00:43.491 --> 00:00:44.258
north Korean history.

00:00:44.392 --> 00:00:47.929
Kim ordered mass production of

00:00:48.062 --> 00:00:49.230
icbms earlier this year.

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:51.232
The parade featured new missiles

00:00:51.265 --> 00:00:53.468
and a new face, Kim Ju ae, Kim's

00:00:53.601 --> 00:00:54.869
daughter, believed to be just 9

00:00:55.003 --> 00:00:55.570
years old.

00:00:55.703 --> 00:00:57.238
She began appearing on state

00:00:57.238 --> 00:00:59.674
media three months ago, fueling

00:00:59.807 --> 00:01:01.242
speculation she's being groomed

00:01:01.242 --> 00:01:03.244
as the next north Korean leader.

00:01:03.378 --> 00:01:05.246
So, given the fact that Kim Jong

00:01:05.246 --> 00:01:06.347
un chose to introduce his

00:01:06.481 --> 00:01:08.349
daughter on the day of his

00:01:08.483 --> 00:01:09.651
previous icbm launch, what do

00:01:09.784 --> 00:01:11.386
you make of the timing and

00:01:11.519 --> 00:01:13.254
symbolism of that?

00:01:13.287 --> 00:01:15.256
&gt;&gt; I think it demonstrates that

00:01:15.390 --> 00:01:17.458
she's being groomed as the next

00:01:17.592 --> 00:01:19.594
leader, and that, to me,

00:01:19.727 --> 00:01:21.262
suggests there could be

00:01:21.262 --> 00:01:21.929
something behind the scenes,

00:01:22.063 --> 00:01:23.931
maybe a health problem with Kim

00:01:24.065 --> 00:01:26.067
Jong un that is accelerating and

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:27.301
they need to do this now rather

00:01:27.435 --> 00:01:28.603
than years later when she's a

00:01:28.736 --> 00:01:30.838
bit older.

00:01:31.272 --> 00:01:31.906
&gt;&gt; Reporter: Kim's daughter now

00:01:32.040 --> 00:01:33.408
a fixture on state media,

00:01:33.541 --> 00:01:34.809
sitting with her father at a

00:01:34.942 --> 00:01:36.944
weekend soccer match, posing

00:01:37.278 --> 00:01:41.282
together for a postage stamp

00:01:41.382 --> 00:01:43.384
dad/daughter and the family

00:01:43.518 --> 00:01:45.286
arsenal.

00:01:45.286 --> 00:01:46.888
Two smaller fires were fired

00:01:47.288 --> 00:01:47.722
Monday.

00:01:47.722 --> 00:01:48.856
The bellicose broadcast came

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:50.658
with a warning from Kim's

00:01:50.792 --> 00:01:52.527
younger sister Kim Yo Jong,

00:01:52.660 --> 00:01:54.062
saying the frequency of using

00:01:54.195 --> 00:01:55.730
the pacific ocean as our

00:01:55.863 --> 00:01:57.298
shooting range depends on the

00:01:57.365 --> 00:02:00.034
nature of the U.S. Military's

00:02:00.168 --> 00:02:00.501
actions.

00:02:00.501 --> 00:02:01.703
She's referring to upcoming

00:02:01.836 --> 00:02:03.671
military drills on the Korean

00:02:03.805 --> 00:02:06.841
peninsula, the U.S., south

00:02:06.974 --> 00:02:08.376
Korea, and Japan responding to

00:02:08.509 --> 00:02:11.412
the icbm launch with joint air

00:02:11.546 --> 00:02:12.814
exercises over the weekend,

00:02:12.947 --> 00:02:14.549
fueling fears of further

00:02:14.682 --> 00:02:15.182
escalation.

00:02:15.316 --> 00:02:17.885
&gt;&gt; If North Korea conducts the

00:02:18.019 --> 00:02:18.686
seventh nuclear test, which

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:20.321
could happen at any time, it

00:02:20.455 --> 00:02:23.324
will be a game changer in the

00:02:23.324 --> 00:02:25.727
sense that North Korea could

00:02:25.860 --> 00:02:29.330
develop and deploy tactical

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:29.830
nuclear missiles.

